NOTICE

ApplyOS is a standalone, contributor-owned job-search framework,
released under the MIT License (see LICENSE).

Lineage: it is built on and derives from the original ai-job-search
framework at https://github.com/MadsLorentzen/ai-job-search, an MIT-licensed
project by Mads Lorentzen. The core application pipeline (self-profiling,
fit evaluation, and the drafter-reviewer application workflow), the LaTeX
templates, and the verification loops originate from that project. The job
search CLI skills lineage also traces back to
https://github.com/mikkelkrogsholm/skills.

This edition adds the India + global-remote portal skills, the company
career-portal scraper, the runtime-agnostic adapter layer, and the
documentation for them.

